'''
(Home  work)
Write  a  program  to  implement  Rock , paper  and  scissors  game  between  user  and  computer

1) What  is  the  result  if  user  input  and  computer  random  number  are  same  ?  ---> Draw  # Answer: It's a draw

2) What  is  the  result  if  computer  selects  paper  and  user  input  is  rock ?  ---> Computer  wins  becoz  parer  dominates  rock  # Answer: Computer wins

3) What  is  the  result  if  computer  selects  scissors  and  user  input  is  paper ?  ---> Computer  wins  becoz  scissors  dominates  paper  # Answer: Computer wins

4) What  is  the  result  if  computer  selects  rock  and  user  input  is  scissors ?  ---> Computer  wins  becoz  rock  dominates  scissors  # Answer: Computer wins

5) What  is  the  result  in  all  other  cases  ?  --->  User  wins  # Answer: User wins
'''

 What  do  you  want  to  select  (0 - Rock , 1 - Paper , 2 - Scissors)  :  1  # User input
User  :   Paper  # Program output
Computer  :   Rock  # Program output
User  wins  # Program output
Continue  (  y / n)  ?  y  # User input
What  do  you  want  to  select  (0 - Rock , 1 - Paper , 2 - Scissors)  :  2  # User input
User  :   Scissors  # Program output
Computer  :   Scissors  # Program output
Draw  # Program output
Continue  (  y / n)  ?  y  # User input
What  do  you  want  to  select  (0 - Rock , 1 - Paper , 2 - Scissors)  :  0  # User input
User  :   Rock  # Program output
Computer  :   Rock  # Program output
Draw  # Program output
Continue  (  y / n)  ?  y  # User input
What  do  you  want  to  select  (0 - Rock , 1 - Paper , 2 - Scissors)  :  1  # User input
User  :   Paper  # Program output
Computer  :   Scissors  # Program output
Computer  wins  # Program output
Continue  (  y / n)  ?  n  # User input
End  of  the  game  # Program output
